00:02:32,830 --> 00:02:36,710
EPISODE 1: BORN AGAIN AT BOTTOM-TIER

70
00:02:35,500 --> 00:02:36,460
Is it yummy?

71
00:02:36,790 --> 00:02:38,170
Num-nums!

72
00:02:38,380 --> 00:02:40,630
Eat all you want, Allen.

73
00:02:42,000 --> 00:02:46,000
I used to be a 35 year-old, uneducated,
broke-ass, romantically inept,

74
00:02:46,000 --> 00:02:47,960
white-collar worker named Kenichi Yamada.

75
00:02:48,130 --> 00:02:50,500
But I've been reincarnated as this little dude, Allen.

76
00:02:51,000 --> 00:02:52,500
Right now, I'm one year old.

77
00:02:52,790 --> 00:02:56,920
I can't talk just yet, but I have no problems
thinking to myself or understanding words.

78
00:02:57,670 --> 00:03:00,920
So it seems like Japanese is the common tongue here.

79
00:02:57,670 --> 00:02:59,460
Someone's got a healthy appetite!

80
00:03:01,210 --> 00:03:02,420
Thank God for that.

81
00:03:02,670 --> 00:03:04,000
Guess he takes after me, huh?

82
00:03:06,130 --> 00:03:10,210
I've been born into a serf family,
just like how I chose at the start.

83
00:03:11,540 --> 00:03:15,290
This is a frontier village where pioneers
pay tax to a ruling lord to cultivate the land,

84
00:03:15,290 --> 00:03:17,170
so it doesn't have a name yet.

85
00:03:18,210 --> 00:03:20,000
Make sure to get your fill, Theresia!

86
00:03:21,630 --> 00:03:23,330
My father's name is Rodin.

87
00:03:23,710 --> 00:03:26,130
He's a real family guy who works hard day after day.

88
00:03:26,580 --> 00:03:28,460
I assume he's around 20 years old.

89
00:03:29,630 --> 00:03:30,790
Thank you, honey.

90
00:03:31,250 --> 00:03:33,000
There we go! Nice and clean!

91
00:03:33,420 --> 00:03:34,880
My mother's name is Theresia.

92
00:03:35,170 --> 00:03:37,630
She's very pretty. And as sweet as can be!

93
00:03:37,960 --> 00:03:39,380
Probably in her late teens.

94
00:03:40,580 --> 00:03:42,460
I'm their only kid right now.

95
00:03:42,670 --> 00:03:46,170
Goodness me, honey! Seems we have
two babies who need their faces cleaned.

96
00:03:46,670 --> 00:03:47,830
Dats wight!

97
00:03:50,710 --> 00:03:54,040
I imagine it's only a matter of time before I get siblings.

98
00:03:57,210 --> 00:03:59,170
Aww. Is it time to go beddy-bye?

99
00:03:59,380 --> 00:04:00,420
Yesh...

100
00:04:04,790 --> 00:04:06,540
Nighty-night, Allen.

101
00:04:08,130 --> 00:04:09,580
Time for the adults to have dinner.

102
00:04:12,630 --> 00:04:14,460
Stat window, open!

103
00:04:16,250 --> 00:04:20,460
Welp. Getting my diapers changed
and suckin' on titties is great and all...

104
00:04:20,880 --> 00:04:23,710
but I'm supposed to be a Summoner now.

105
00:04:24,290 --> 00:04:26,290
Really wish I could do something with it.

106
00:04:27,290 --> 00:04:30,080
I've lost count of how many times I've tried.

107
00:04:30,750 --> 00:04:32,710
Stat window, open!

108
00:04:36,420 --> 00:04:37,000
Allen?!

109
00:04:37,000 --> 00:04:38,380
Oh, crap! I can't let them see!

110
00:04:38,380 --> 00:04:39,460
Go away, book!

111
00:04:39,670 --> 00:04:41,130
Are you okay, Allen?!

112
00:04:44,250 --> 00:04:46,170
Just talking in his sleep, I guess?

113
00:04:47,380 --> 00:04:49,500
Gosh, that scared me!

114
00:04:49,750 --> 00:04:51,040
Sleep tight, little fella.

115
00:04:53,710 --> 00:04:55,040
Whew, close call.

116
00:04:56,790 --> 00:04:58,080
Let's try that again.

117
00:04:58,670 --> 00:05:00,250
Appear, my book!

118
00:05:02,790 --> 00:05:03,630
And open!

119
00:05:05,750 --> 00:05:07,040
Now we're talking!

120
00:05:07,920 --> 00:05:09,420
After a whole year of trying...

