Woot! My first look at a real monster!

392
00:10:33,670 --> 00:10:35,330
Wanna see Gweat Boawr!

393
00:10:35,460 --> 00:10:36,670
All righty!

394
00:10:36,960 --> 00:10:39,420
They're carving it up now. Let's go check it out.

395
00:10:39,420 --> 00:10:40,960
Yay!

396
