398
00:10:55,880 --> 00:10:56,750
See there, Allen?

399
00:10:57,960 --> 00:10:59,290
Those are Albaherons.

400
00:10:59,460 --> 00:11:01,040
Awabahera?

401
00:11:01,210 --> 00:11:02,210
Albaheron.

402
00:11:02,540 --> 00:11:05,540
They flock together and head north at this time of year.

403
00:11:06,170 --> 00:11:07,960
They're monsters that signal the coming of fall.

404
00:11:08,330 --> 00:11:09,750
Monshter?

405
00:11:12,080 --> 00:11:14,460
Oh, sorry!

406
00:11:17,580 --> 00:11:22,040
