I named you after the Albaheron.

407
00:11:23,830 --> 00:11:26,210
For them, the sky is the limit.

408
00:11:27,630 --> 00:11:31,420
They can use their wings
to fly wherever they want in the world.

409
00:11:32,790 --> 00:11:34,130
That's true freedom.

410
00:11:35,290 --> 00:11:36,420
Sounds great, huh?

411
00:11:38,080 --> 00:11:42,960
