00:15:19,880 --> 00:15:22,710
Dominate the stats and you dominate the game!

609
00:15:23,580 --> 00:15:29,250
The key to becoming a kickass Summoner is knowing
all about the various stat buffs of your creatures!

610
00:15:30,080 --> 00:15:33,210
So much depth and complexity!
Now THIS is hardcore gaming!

611
00:15:34,380 --> 00:15:36,330
Ow! Ouch, ouch, ouch...

612
00:15:37,920 --> 00:15:41,040
But I'm still not fighting monsters anytime soon.

613
00:15:45,790 --> 00:15:47,420
Already 3 o'clock, huh?

614
00:15:48,000 --> 00:15:49,830
Here comes trouble...

615
00:15:50,130 --> 00:15:52,790
Allen! Let's play dueling knights!

616
00:15:55,460 --> 00:15:59,460
THE HARDCORE GAMER DOMINATES

617
00:15:55,460 --> 00:15:59,460
IN ANOTHER WORLD WITH GARBAGE BALANCING

618
00:15:59,920 --> 00:16:02,920
I am Krena the Fierce! Have at thee!

619
00:16:03,670 --> 00:16:05,330
I am Allen the Honorable!

620
00:16:05,330 --> 00:16:07,500
I accept your challenge to a fair duel!

621
00:16:07,750 --> 00:16:10,040
Ugh! This is the opposite of cool.

622
00:16:10,290 --> 00:16:13,540
But I have to take these play fights with Krena seriously.

623
00:16:17,830 --> 00:16:20,130
Dude, how is she so fast?!

624
00:16:20,250 --> 00:16:23,920
I poured all my creature buffs into agility
and I can barely keep up!

625
00:16:25,290 --> 00:16:26,580
She is too OP!

626
00:16:27,040 --> 00:16:28,920
I'm only getting started!

627
00:16:32,670 --> 00:16:35,710
Aw, it's Krena! Come for another playdate?

628
00:16:35,920 --> 00:16:37,960
I played dueling knights with Allen!

629
00:16:38,250 --> 00:16:38,960
How nice.

630
00:16:39,460 --> 00:16:42,250
But it's getting dark now.
So you should head home, okay?

631
00:16:42,460 --> 00:16:43,380
Okay!

632
00:16:43,670 --> 00:16:45,500
See ya tomorrow, Allen!

633
00:16:48,500 --> 00:16:49,960
What a trooper.

634
00:16:49,960 --> 00:16:51,630
That's my son for you!

635
00:16:51,880 --> 00:16:52,710
Huff.

636
00:16:52,830 --> 00:16:55,290
Oh, Mommy! Let me take those!

637
00:16:55,290 --> 00:16:57,250
Why thank you.

638
00:16:57,630 --> 00:16:59,290
You're such a good boy, Allen.

639
00:17:03,750 --> 00:17:08,920
Hey, Daddy? I wanna help you guys harvest the taters,
since Mommy has a big tummy now.

640
00:17:08,920 --> 00:17:09,750
Huh?!

641
00:17:10,750 --> 00:17:12,830
I can do it, I'm strong!

642
00:17:13,290 --> 00:17:18,380
At any rate, it's safe to say that I have
the stamina of a full grown adult now.

643
00:17:18,710 --> 00:17:22,040
It's okay. Kids like you shouldn't have to work.

644
00:17:22,210 --> 00:17:24,040
Just play with Krena, okay?

645
00:17:24,040 --> 00:17:25,250
Your mom's right.

646
00:17:25,580 --> 00:17:29,210
You've already been helping us
around the house. That's plenty!

647
00:17:29,380 --> 00:17:30,250
But...

648
00:17:30,420 --> 00:17:31,460
No buts.

649
00:17:31,960 --> 00:17:35,920
You'll end up doing it eventually.
So enjoy life without farm work while you can.

650
00:17:36,580 --> 00:17:37,710
Oh, right.

651
00:17:38,580 --> 00:17:41,420
We're basically stuck in the serf class forever.

652
00:17:42,210 --> 00:17:45,170
And working the farms
is on a different level from house chores.

653
00:17:45,630 --> 00:17:47,290
It's real grueling stuff.

654
00:17:48,000 --> 00:17:51,040
I wouldn't wish that on my three year old son, either.

655
00:17:51,830 --> 00:17:52,630
Okay.

656
00:17:54,170 --> 00:17:55,420
Good to hear!

657
00:17:57,420 --> 00:18:02,670
Say, Allen? I noticed you've been
throwing rocks at the tree out back lately.

658
00:18:03,790 --> 00:18:05,130
What're you doing that for?

659
00:18:05,460 --> 00:18:09,210
You told me there are monsters
in the forests outside the house.

660
00:18:09,420 --> 00:18:11,290
So I'll protect mommy from them with rocks!

661
00:18:11,540 --> 00:18:14,080
Shucks! Aren't you brave?

662
00:18:14,080 --> 00:18:19,170
To tell the truth, I was only doing that to see
if I could learn skills aside from summoning.

663
00:18:14,960 --> 00:18:16,460
You're such a good boy, Allen.

664
00:18:19,790 --> 00:18:21,830
You'll protect Krena, too, won't you?

665
00:18:22,580 --> 00:18:24,080
Mm-hmm.

666
00:18:26,420 --> 00:18:30,380
You two have so much fun playing knights.
I can't wait for your Appraisal Ceremony!

667
00:18:30,880 --> 00:18:32,290
What's that?

668
00:18:32,630 --> 00:18:37,080
When you turn five years old, there is a divine ceremony
to determine what kind of talent you have.

669
00:18:37,290 --> 00:18:41,380
With any luck, a good talent
will help you break out of serfdom!

670
00:18:42,040 --> 00:18:43,630
A talent, huh?

671
00:18:48,790 --> 00:18:51,420
Oh! Denka's still bouncing like a champ.

672
00:18:51,920 --> 00:18:56,170
So, now I know that I can summon a creature
for a whole day without any problems.

673
00:18:56,170 --> 00:18:57,750
Great! That's big progress!

674
00:18:57,750 --> 00:18:58,960
Allen!

675
00:18:58,960 --> 00:19:00,380
Oh, crap!

676
00:19:01,250 --> 00:19:04,880
A fat lot of good it does for a Summoner
to hone sword skills!

677
00:19:04,880 --> 00:19:06,170
You're wide open!

678
00:19:06,170 --> 00:19:07,290
Yargh!

679
00:19:10,040 --> 00:19:13,580
Yo, Allen! Looks like you didn't get
knocked flat this time...

680
00:19:14,710 --> 00:19:15,710
Never mind.

681
00:19:17,790 --> 00:19:19,380
Theresia, I'm home!

682
00:19:19,380 --> 00:19:21,170
Welcome home, honey.

683
00:19:23,710 --> 00:19:24,290
Theresia?!

684
00:19:24,330 --> 00:19:26,500
Oh, crap! I left Denka out!

685
00:19:27,210 --> 00:19:27,960
Theresia!

686
00:19:28,420 --> 00:19:31,170
It's all right. Just a little jump scare.

687
00:19:31,580 --> 00:19:33,790
Uh-oh! Is the baby coming?!

688
00:19:34,130 --> 00:19:36,420
Krena! Go fetch your mom, would you?

689
00:19:36,420 --> 00:19:37,630
Roger that!

690
00:19:44,210 --> 00:19:46,920
Kinda wishing I had played a birthing sim about now!

691
00:19:47,630 --> 00:19:49,790
The hot water is ready! What's next?

692
00:19:50,000 --> 00:19:52,830
Uh, shoot... what else is there?

693
00:19:52,830 --> 00:19:54,040
Daddy!

694
00:19:55,880 --> 00:19:57,130
Help has arrived!

695
00:19:57,420 --> 00:19:58,380
Mathilda!

696
00:19:58,670 --> 00:20:01,000
Wait, Gerda? What are you doing here?

697
00:20:01,420 --> 00:20:03,080
Too anxious to stay put, y'know?

698
00:20:04,500 --> 00:20:08,080
Okay, all men outside! Just let the ladies handle this!

699
00:20:25,250 --> 00:20:25,960
Theresia!

700
00:20:26,170 --> 00:20:27,580
Way to go, sweetheart!

701
00:20:27,750 --> 00:20:28,580
Wh-what'd we get?

702
00:20:28,830 --> 00:20:30,210
It's a baby boy.

703
00:20:30,330 --> 00:20:32,790
Another son, huh? Oh, what joy!

704
00:20:32,920 --> 00:20:35,000
You should name him, honey.

705
00:20:35,580 --> 00:20:37,500
Sure! I have one ready to go!

706
00:20:37,960 --> 00:20:39,170
This little fella will be...

707
00:20:39,540 --> 00:20:40,250
Mash!

708
00:20:40,960 --> 00:20:44,880
Mash? I love it. Mash!

709
00:20:45,250 --> 00:20:49,170
Wait a second. This better not be another name
that you took from a monster!

710
00:20:49,170 --> 00:20:56,710
Uh, well... Theresia, my love... the thing is...

711
00:21:02,330 --> 00:21:03,500
Oh, you!

712
00:21:05,670 --> 00:21:08,460
Y'know, I can't help but wonder why I reincarnated.

713
00:21:09,540 --> 00:21:13,380
I mean, aside from the fact I desperately wished to play a
hardcore game with garbage balancing.

714
00:21:13,540 --> 00:21:19,130
Speaking as the broke-ass, uneducated, romantically
inept, and totally average joe I used to be...

715
00:21:19,210 --> 00:21:23,790
I'm not sad to leave my past life behind.

716
00:21:24,170 --> 00:21:27,630
Because there's nothing that can hold me back now.

717
00:21:28,000 --> 00:21:32,380
I'm totally gonna horde the best equipment and max out
every one of my stats.

718
00:21:34,290 --> 00:21:36,170
But I gotta admit...

719
00:21:36,830 --> 00:21:37,790
C'mere, Allen.

720
00:21:38,880 --> 00:21:41,000
Say hello to your little brother.

721
00:21:43,920 --> 00:21:45,170
Hi, Mash.

722
00:21:45,710 --> 00:21:48,080
...this family stuff is pretty nice, too.

723
00:21:52,330 --> 00:21:53,750
Oh, s-sorry!

724
00:21:53,750 --> 00:21:55,250
That's okay.

725
00:21:55,670 --> 00:21:57,920
You were even louder than this when you were born.

726
00:21:57,920 --> 00:21:59,540
Really?

727
00:22:00,500 --> 00:22:02,920
I'm not exactly sure how I'll pull it off.

728
00:22:04,080 --> 00:22:08,330
But I want to free all of my family
from the drudgery of serfdom.

